# Baron Helmut Zemo: a player may give up casting a copy (CR 733.1) and the cast is undone as if never begun, so the copy is not
# spent and counts for nothing towards the three. The setup is the first boast scenario's, but the third Entomb takes Duress, so
# the Excruciator, Pox Plague, Griselbrand and Duress (6 + 5 + 4 + 1) are exiled. Bot1 starts casting the Duress copy and cancels
# at its target; the cast is undone, and Bot1 is asked again: it casts the Griselbrand copy, then the Duress copy after all
# (its target, Bot2's hand of Islands, has no card to take), and stops with two cast.

